# Localization

Languages: English `en`, Hindi `hi`, Punjabi `pa`.

Files only:
- `lib/l10n/app_en.arb`
- `lib/l10n/app_hi.arb`
- `lib/l10n/app_pa.arb`

Rules:
- Every user-facing string from generated l10n — never hardcode in widgets.
- Add new keys to all three ARB files. No per-screen string files. No duplicate keys.
- One reusable `LanguageSelector` + Riverpod `LocaleProvider`.
- Show on Welcome and later Settings/Profile.
- Persist locale; apply on launch; update UI without restart.
